# Drop your reference photos in this folder.
#
# Naming: {style-id}.jpg (or .png)
# Examples:
#   teddy-bear.jpg
#   puppy-cut.jpg
#   lion-cut.jpg
#   continental.jpg
#   powder-puff.jpg
#   summer-shave.jpg
#   mohawk.jpg
#
# These are sent to Gemini alongside the user's photo as a visual target
# for the haircut. The model copies the cut from the reference onto the
# dog in the user's photo, preserving the user photo's identity + background.
#
# Use a poodle or doodle as the reference dog — they generalize well to
# other breeds. Square or 4:5 aspect, 1024px on the long edge is plenty.
